{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Help Wanted: Cherry Hill Cemetery seeks an individual for part-time work. Position: Pallbearer\u2026 <strong>Huh? What\u2019s a pallbearer?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Duties: Carrying caskets\u2026 <strong>Oh.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Apply in person after dusk\u2026 <strong>Hmm\u2026 seems worth a shot!&quot;</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2014The Part-Timer</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control Two Characters-Solo or Local Co-op!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate your left hand and right hand or work with a friend, help the two pallbearers carry the casket to the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553350/extras/5616415911bf5f13987b60da62df8c48.poster.avif?t=1757271686\" width=496 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553350/extras/5616415911bf5f13987b60da62df8c48.webm?t=1757271686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553350/extras/5616415911bf5f13987b60da62df8c48.mp4?t=1757271686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Goofy Ragdoll Physics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t drop the body on the ground! Tilt the casket, toss him around, and make sure the \u201cclient\u201d stays well and happy. Pick up some garbage along the way\u2014if you did drop him, just stitch him back together. Repair the casket along the way if a piece or two falls apart\u2014it\u2019s a fragile one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553350/extras/46edbd9542da1083ae35552640da940b.poster.avif?t=1757271686\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553350/extras/46edbd9542da1083ae35552640da940b.webm?t=1757271686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553350/extras/46edbd9542da1083ae35552640da940b.mp4?t=1757271686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Through the Gloomy Cemetery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through the old cemetery, carefully walk the narrow bridges, avoid open graves, dodge the falling boulders, and watch out for the mysterious hands lurking in the dark\u2026</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3553350?t=1757271686","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553350/fcec54423cdf98eaf3bb0bda3cd88d4eb133fc8b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757271686","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553350/0c0e9459aabc8f51ee816a13fe3b678cb1f75a56/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757271686","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553350/0c0e9459aabc8f51ee816a13fe3b678cb1f75a56/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757271686","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Help Wanted: Cherry Hill Cemetery seeks an individual for part-time work. Position: Pallbearer\u2026 <strong>Huh? What\u2